      "description": "读取待压缩消息中的 ERA 变量及函数操作标签，解析其 JSON 和原文位置，再按正文与事务边界分段。只有相邻、同作用域且中间无非空正文的事务可以组成一组；未知作用域保持原样。这里决定处理顺序及可重写范围，不应用操作或删掉正文。",
      "category": "ERA 命令压缩",
      "version": "1.1.0",
      "flow_kind": "process",
      "contract": {
        "requires": [
          {
            "type": "era.command_compaction.request",
            "cardinality": "exactly_one",
            "display_name": "压缩请求"
          }
        ],
        "provides": [
          {
            "key": "parsed",
            "type": "era.command_compaction.parsed",
            "display_name": "整层解析与有序分段"
          }
        ],
        "input_semantics": {
          "era.command_compaction.request": [
            "压缩请求"
          ]
        },
        "output_semantics": {
          "parsed": [
            "整层解析与有序分段"
          ]
        },
        "params_schema": {},
        "params_defaults": {},
        "examples": []
      },
      "implementations": [
        {
          "language": "typescript",
          "targets": [
            "browser",
            "node"
          ],
          "source": {
            "kind": "file",
            "ref": "nodes/parse_command_blocks.ts",
            "export": "run"
          },
          "completion": "immediate"
        }
      ]
    },
    "era.command_compaction.render_compaction_result": {
      "display_name": "输出已确认结果",
      "description": "将整层验证已经形成的结果直接交给公开输出，包括压缩状态、内容、最终变量和函数、诊断、保留理由、解析命令及随机偏移。当前节点只是接口转接，不另做一次压缩或“美化”失败状态，也不将候选保存到聊天。",
      "category": "ERA 命令压缩",
      "version": "1.1.0",
      "flow_kind": "process",
      "contract": {
        "requires": [
          {
            "type": "era.command_compaction.verified",
            "cardinality": "exactly_one",
            "display_name": "整层确认结果"
          }
        ],
        "provides": [
          {
            "key": "compaction_response",
            "type": "era.command_compaction.response",
            "display_name": "原公共返回格式"
          }
        ],
        "input_semantics": {
          "era.command_compaction.verified": [
            "整层确认结果"
          ]
        },
        "output_semantics": {
          "compaction_response": [
            "原公共返回格式"
          ]
        },
        "params_schema": {},
        "params_defaults": {},
        "examples": []
      },
      "implementations": [
        {
          "language": "typescript",
          "targets": [
            "browser",
            "node"
          ],
          "source": {
            "kind": "file",
            "ref": "nodes/render_compaction_result.ts",
            "export": "run"
          },
          "completion": "immediate"
        }
      ]
    },
    "era.command_compaction.rewrite_safe_regions": {
      "display_name": "生成段候选",
      "description": "依据变量、函数和随机依赖分析，为能证明安全的区域生成较短的替换文本，保留原命令与位置作为验证依据。这里只提出候选，没有候选或不安全部分继续保留原文；单事务及不同作用域不能被随意合并，分段合并时还会再次核对允许重写的条件。",
      "category": "ERA 命令压缩",
      "version": "1.1.0",
      "flow_kind": "process",
      "contract": {
        "requires": [
          {
            "type": "era.command_compaction.symbols",
            "cardinality": "exactly_one",
            "display_name": "依赖及屏障"
          }
        ],
        "provides": [
          {
            "key": "candidate",
            "type": "era.command_compaction.candidate",
            "display_name": "段候选"
          }
        ],
        "input_semantics": {
          "era.command_compaction.symbols": [
            "依赖及屏障"
          ]
        },
        "output_semantics": {
          "candidate": [
            "段候选"
          ]
        },
        "params_schema": {},
        "params_defaults": {},
        "examples": []
      },
      "implementations": [
        {
          "language": "typescript",
          "targets": [
            "browser",
            "node"
          ],
          "source": {
            "kind": "file",
            "ref": "nodes/rewrite_safe_regions.ts",
            "export": "run"
          },
          "completion": "immediate"
        }
      ]
    },
    "era.command_compaction.select_segment": {
      "display_name": "准备当前段与起点",
      "description": "按游标取出当前正文段或同作用域事务组，将前段结束后的变量、函数和随机偏移作为它的执行起点，保留整份分段状态供结果合并。无事务包装的原请求保持其原快照默认规则。这里准备当前段输入，不跳段、不改原文，也不抽取随机数。",
      "category": "ERA 命令压缩",
      "version": "1.1.0",
      "flow_kind": "process",
      "contract": {
        "requires": [
          {
            "type": "era.command_compaction.segment.state",
            "cardinality": "exactly_one",
            "display_name": "顺序状态"
          }
        ],
        "provides": [
          {
            "key": "parsed",
            "type": "era.command_compaction.parsed",
            "display_name": "当前段解析结果"
          },
          {
            "key": "segment_state_before",
            "type": "era.command_compaction.segment.state.before",
            "display_name": "本段起始状态"
          }
        ],
        "input_semantics": {
          "era.command_compaction.segment.state": [
            "顺序状态"
          ]
        },
        "output_semantics": {
          "parsed": [
            "当前段解析结果"
          ],
          "segment_state_before": [
            "保持本段起始状态供推进游标"
          ]
        },
        "params_schema": {},
        "params_defaults": {},
        "examples": []
      },
      "implementations": [
        {
          "language": "typescript",
          "targets": [
            "browser",
            "node"
          ],
          "source": {
            "kind": "file",
            "ref": "nodes/select_segment.ts",
            "export": "run"
          },
          "completion": "immediate"
        }
      ]
    },
    "era.command_compaction.terminal": {
      "display_name": "命令压缩终端",
      "description": "本工作流的结构起点或终点标记，执行时返回空结果，不计算表达式、不替换文本，也不读写酒馆。它只明确流程的入口或出口，业务输入与结果通过已声明的数据通道传递；最终结果由实际处理节点产生。",
      "category": "ERA 命令压缩",
      "version": "1.0.0",
      "flow_kind": "terminal",
      "contract": {
        "requires": [],
        "provides": [],
        "input_semantics": {},
